        "Summer in Deoria is hot and long, and power cuts are a real possibility in May and June. For students who sit May exams, a morning slot before the heat, with a laptop charged the night before, is usually the most dependable arrangement. Winter fog affects early mornings, so evenings suit the cold months better.",
